SAE/group19 core adapted from https://github.com/spr-networks/oxwifid
Revision: 254818c6ee55937a20ac27ece62b2202baef3acf
Upstream files: src/auth/wpa3/{sae,group19}.rs. Upstream Cargo.toml declares MIT.
Copyright: SPR Networks and oxwifid contributors.

Local adaptations: module paths; remove unrelated OWE re-exports; explicit caller
scalars instead of an OS RNG so the same peer is available on native and WASM;
local equal-length constant-time authenticator comparison; current stable Clippy
chunks iteration and helper placement. J.10 tests and AES-CMAC are adapted from
tests/sae_vectors.rs and src/auth/crypto.rs under the same declared MIT license. Protocol/curve code
remains upstream and is checked with independent Espressif/IEEE known answers.
Virtual-AP deterministic keys are for simulation, not production Wi-Fi security.

